WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.600
Narrator: So who leads? It depends on the incident.

2
00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:08.800
Narrator: Fire, smoke, a damaged structure, a gas leak - Civil Defence take command.

3
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.800
Narrator: Who leads an evacuation is set in the venue plan.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:23.100
Narrator: A suspicious item, a threat, a fight, serious disorder, or someone refusing to leave - the police take command, with Security.

5
00:00:23.300 --> 00:00:27.900
Narrator: A sick or injured person - the Red Crescent, with Civil Defence.

6
00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:33.100
Narrator: All of them work together in the venue control room, the VOC.

7
00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:41.800
Narrator: And if two things happen at once, they coordinate between them - your job is to follow the approved source of instructions.

